flowchart TD
    I[HTTP agent session ingress] --> K[RunLoopWithOptions single agent kernel]
    Y[Capability profiler CLI ingress] --> K
    C[Chronos ingress] --> K
    S[SubAgent ingress] --> K
    T[Team worker ingress] --> K
    B[Bridge ingress] --> K
    A[ACP prompt ingress] --> K
    K --> M{RunMode configured?}
    M -->|Yes| R[Phase and directive controller only]
    M -->|No| P[Resolve immutable harness, context plan, and tool catalog]
    R --> P
    R -->|Mode error| X[Typed blocked or failure outcome]
    P --> Q{Context and catalog valid?}
    Q -->|No| X
    Q -->|Yes| V[Call provider and parse bounded response]
    V -->|Transport or parser failure| X
    V --> U{Contains tool calls?}
    U -->|Yes| G[Common schema, permission, approval, sandbox, journal, and dispatch]
    G -->|Denied, journal-failed, or execution-failed| X
    G -->|Executed after durable marker when configured| W[Persist tool results and evidence]
    W --> K
    U -->|No| O{Completion contract and evidence satisfied?}
    O -->|Yes| F[Idempotent terminal finalizer]
    O -->|Blocked or incomplete| X
    X --> F
    F --> Z([SessionEnd, recorder terminal, typed done, channel close])
